# Dissection Practice: the "up to one" slots may be left empty (CR 115.1d, 601.2c). Here the +1/+1 slot chooses nothing and the -1/-1
# slot chooses Misshapen Fiend (1/1), which dies as a state-based action (CR 704.5f). The drain still happens, and with a single
# opponent Bot2 is the lone candidate. Control: the previous scenario, where a +1/+1 on the same creature keeps it alive.

